WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:07,010
That's it for half a bowl per person

2
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:12,130
Eggs are like water

3
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:23,830
What's the point of the new brand?

4
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:25,650
Listen to what I have to say

5
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,250
I need someone over there in the highlands.

6
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:28,930
Go to one the next day

7
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:30,970
Go to the Tianhei Party in the morning

8
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:33,210
What can you do in one day?

9
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:35,970
Centimeters will also be inherited for daily work done.

10
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:37,730
If I were the first to go

11
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:39,490
I don’t know if I can catch the meat.

12
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,140
What can be caught

13
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,540
It depends on how much you do

14
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,980
The ugly thing to say is that the front was screwed up.

15
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:53,300
If you win all, I will deduct cents and I will repay you.

16
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:54,860
I paid for this first one

17
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,860
As for grabbing it like this?

18
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:01,270
Go and work as cattle and horses for others

19
00:01:01,710 --> 00:01:03,390
We are really in charge of our camp.
